{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"spell_beam_segment","model_identifier":"spell_beam_segment","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# spell_beam_segment\n\nBattle-mage beam segment: a short glowing tube 16 u long, a white-violet core inside a violet sheath. Origin at one end (z = 0), the tube runs to z = -16; the game stretches it along Z between wand and target.\n\n- Bounds (first set): x -3..3, y -3..3, z -16..0 units (0.15 x 0.15 x 0.45 m). Origin at the base centre, front faces -Z.\n- Texture: 32 x 32, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering; every visible face has its own region painted with its material at world position (identical faces share one). No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: 6.\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 5 x 5 x 16 (w x h x d), centred at x 0, z -8\n\n- Glowing cubes (`glow_*`): glow_core, glow_crackle0, glow_crackle1, glow_crackle2, glow_crackle3, glow_sheath\n\n## Notes\n\n- Bright simple glowing shapes; every lit cube is named `glow_*` (flat colours; the game may scale, spin and fade them). No particles or lights in the file.\n"},"resolution":{"width":32,"height":32},"elements":[{"name":"glow_sheath","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-2.0,-2.0,-16.0],"to":[2.0,2.0,0.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[16.0,18.0,20.0,22.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0.0,18.0,16.0,22.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[16.0,18.0,20.0,22.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[0.0,18.0,16.0,22.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[4.0,0.0,8.0,16.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[4.0,0.0,8.0,16.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"2d8fa552-9d29-50e0-bc56-b672e919fd25"},{"name":"glow_core","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modelin